Event sourcing (Opened, Credited, Debited, Expired).

61
00:04:27.869 --> 00:04:28.552
Why:

62
00:04:28.832 --> 00:04:34.485
Balance must be explainable; RBI or finance audit; disputes need exact history.

63
00:04:34.765 --> 00:04:35.939
Order lifecycle.

64
00:04:36.219 --> 00:04:37.051
Pattern:

65
00:04:37.331 --> 00:04:41.021
State in tables + events via outbox (Ch 13).

66
00:04:41.301 --> 00:04:41.984
Why:

67
00:04:42.264 --> 00:04:45.037
Current state is what matters; events for others.

68
00:04:45.317 --> 00:04:48.069
Order tracking, order history, store dashboard.

69
00:04:48.349 --> 00:04:49.181
Pattern:

70
00:04:49.461 --> 00:04:52.384
CQRS read models built from order events.

71
00:04:52.664 --> 00:04:53.347
Why:

72
00:04:53.627 --> 00:04:57.445
Query shapes differ from the write model; scale reads independently.

73
00:04:57.725 --> 00:04:59.219
Search, recommendations.

74
00:04:59.499 --> 00:05:00.331
Pattern:

75
00:05:00.611 --> 00:05:03.384
Read models in OpenSearch or feature stores.

76
00:05:03.664 --> 00:05:04.347
Why:

77
00:05:04.627 --> 00:05:07.827
Specialized stores fed by events (Ch 22).

78
00:05:08.107 --> 00:05:10.347
Catalog updates to other services.

79
00:05:10.627 --> 00:05:11.459
Pattern:

80
00:05:11.739 --> 00:05:15.536
Event-carried state transfer (ProductUpdated with full product).

81
00:05:15.816 --> 00:05:16.499
Why:

82
00:05:16.779 --> 00:05:19.573
Consumers keep local copies; no callbacks.

83
00:05:20.923 --> 00:05:22.566
Order shipped notifications.

84
00:05:22.846 --> 00:05:23.678
Pattern:

85
00:05:23.958 --> 00:05:26.411
Event notification + small payload.

86
00:05:26.691 --> 00:05:27.374
Why:

87
00:05:27.654 --> 00:05:29.403
Consumers need only the fact.

88
00:05:29.683 --> 00:05:30.409
Cart.

89
00:05:30.689 --> 00:05:31.521
Pattern:

90
00:05:31.801 --> 00:05:34.190
Plain table (+ events for analytics).

91
00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:35.153
Why:

92
00:05:35.433 --> 00:05:38.569
No business need for history (§1.1).

93
00:05:38.849 --> 00:05:40.363
Delivery slot bookings.

94
00:05:40.643 --> 00:05:41.475
Pattern:

95
00:05:41.755 --> 00:05:44.827
Event-sourced aggregate per slot (Ch 48).

96
00:05:45.107 --> 00:05:45.790
Why:

97
00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.459
Contention + audit of who took which slot.

98
00:05:49.809 --> 00:05:51.132
Learning objectives.

99
00:05:51.412 --> 00:05:52.756
Here is a quick table:

100
00:05:53.036 --> 00:05:55.233
Band, and After this chapter you can....

