00:41:29.783 --> 00:41:41.175
Each writer's transaction took its globalposition at insert and committed a few milliseconds later, so the projector moved its checkpoint past positions that became visible afterwards.

605
00:41:41.455 --> 00:41:52.207
The xid-safe projector reads only events from transactions older than the oldest still-running one (txid pgsnapshotxmin(...)), in (txid, position) order.

