00:41:52.487 --> 00:41:53.532
It missed 0.

607
00:41:54.882 --> 00:42:04.098
The broken read model was repaired by a rebuild: truncate, reset the checkpoint, replay all 12,000 events in 549 ms.

608
00:42:04.378 --> 00:42:07.983
