00:48:17.454 --> 00:48:18.883
That read model only.

715
00:48:19.163 --> 00:48:20.166
Mitigation:

716
00:48:20.446 --> 00:48:24.862
Per-projection error handling; skip-and-park with alert; fix and resume.

717
00:48:25.142 --> 00:48:26.891
Lossy or buggy upcaster.

718
00:48:27.171 --> 00:48:28.366
Detection signal:

719
00:48:28.646 --> 00:48:31.270
Golden tests; reconciliation of sums.

720
00:48:31.550 --> 00:48:32.766
Blast radius:

721
00:48:33.046 --> 00:48:35.457
Wrong derived state everywhere (L4:

722
00:48:35.737 --> 00:48:37.977
57.40 rupees).

723
00:48:38.257 --> 00:48:39.259
Mitigation:

724
00:48:39.539 --> 00:48:43.337
Exact types; tests on production samples; rebuild after fix.

725
00:48:43.617 --> 00:48:45.089
Unbounded stream growth.

726
00:48:45.369 --> 00:48:46.563
Detection signal:

727
00:48:46.843 --> 00:48:49.211
Stream length p99, load time.

728
00:48:49.491 --> 00:48:50.707
Blast radius:

729
00:48:50.987 --> 00:48:52.097
Slow commands.

730
00:48:52.377 --> 00:48:53.379
Mitigation:

731
00:48:53.659 --> 00:48:55.025
Snapshots (L4:

732
00:48:55.305 --> 00:48:57.801
3.4 ms), period closing.

733
00:48:58.081 --> 00:48:59.425
Rebuild takes too long.

734
00:48:59.705 --> 00:49:00.899
Detection signal:

735
00:49:01.179 --> 00:49:03.078
Rebuild ETA versus SLO.

736
00:49:03.358 --> 00:49:04.574
Blast radius:

737
00:49:04.854 --> 00:49:06.667
Can't fix read models quickly.

738
00:49:06.947 --> 00:49:07.950
Mitigation:

739
00:49:08.230 --> 00:49:11.281
Parallel rebuild by stream hash; blue or green.

740
00:49:12.631 --> 00:49:14.444
Side effects re-run on replay.

741
00:49:14.724 --> 00:49:15.919
Detection signal:

742
00:49:16.199 --> 00:49:18.396
Duplicate emails after a rebuild.

743
00:49:18.676 --> 00:49:19.892
Blast radius:

744
00:49:20.172 --> 00:49:21.303
Customer-visible.

745
00:49:21.583 --> 00:49:22.585
Mitigation:

746
00:49:22.865 --> 00:49:26.385
Reactors separate from projectors; dedup by event id.

747
00:49:26.665 --> 00:49:27.945
PII in events.

748
00:49:28.225 --> 00:49:29.420
Detection signal:

749
00:49:29.700 --> 00:49:32.047
Data scan, DPDP requests.

750
00:49:32.327 --> 00:49:33.543
Blast radius:

751
00:49:33.823 --> 00:49:34.719
Compliance.

752
00:49:34.999 --> 00:49:36.001
Mitigation:

753
00:49:36.281 --> 00:49:38.628
PII out of events; crypto-shredding.

754
00:49:39.978 --> 00:49:41.066
Observability.

755
00:49:41.346 --> 00:49:53.719
Per projection: lag in positions and seconds, events per second applied, errors, last checkpoint time, and a completeness check (count and sum per stream type versus the store, run periodically).

756
00:49:53.999 --> 00:50:03.066
Event store: appends per second, conflicts per second by stream type, stream length histogram, snapshot hit rate and age, DB size growth.

757
00:50:03.346 --> 00:50:09.469
Commands: load time (events read per load), decide or append latency, and retries per command.

758
00:50:09.749 --> 00:50:16.447
Upcasters: invocations by type and version (shows how much legacy data is still read), and failures.

759
00:50:17.797 --> 00:50:28.037
Metadata on every event (correlation id, causation id, user, HLC) makes why is this balance 0 rupees? a query, not an investigation.

760
00:50:29.387 --> 00:50:30.326
Security.

761
00:50:30.606 --> 00:50:36.003
Append-only enforcement: application roles get INSERT and SELECT only on events.

762
00:50:36.283 --> 00:50:39.270
Corrections are compensating events, never updates.

763
00:50:39.550 --> 00:50:46.163
Event metadata records who issued the command (user or service identity), and it's part of the audit trail.

764
00:50:46.443 --> 00:50:50.497
PII: keep references in events and details in mutable stores.

765
00:50:50.777 --> 00:51:02.702
Encrypt unavoidable PII with per-subject keys (crypto-shredding), and propagate erasure to read models, search indexes, caches, backups and the warehouse (Ch 36).

766
00:51:04.052 --> 00:51:11.455
Read models may aggregate data from many streams: apply authorization at the query API, not in projections.

767
00:51:12.805 --> 00:51:14.469
