Keeps xmin advancing for projectors.

799
00:52:10.280 --> 00:52:12.435
Index (txid, globalposition).

800
00:52:12.715 --> 00:52:13.632
Default here:

801
00:52:13.912 --> 00:52:14.808
Required.

802
